---
globs:
  - "src/review/ci/**"
  - "src/agentWork/prHeadCiState.ts"
  - "src/state/prHeadCiState.ts"
  - "src/agentWork/ciAuthoring.ts"
  - "src/agentWork/reviewVerdict.ts"
  - "src/agentWork/executors/ciProjectionExecutor.ts"
  - "src/state/intake.ts"
---
CI facts live in `app_state.sqlite` (`src/state/prHeadCiState.ts`), never model text. `check_run` and `status` deliveries apply CI facts inside `src/state/intake.ts` and schedule projection through `requestHeadCiProjection`, the only path. `classifySnapshot` in `ciFacts.ts` derives the rollup; an incomplete check page is `unknown`, not passing. The model fills only `headline`, `reason`, `fixHint` (`ciSummaryLlmSchema`); `mergeCiSummaryWithFacts` overwrites `status` and failure names from facts, and `authorHeadCiIfFactsChanged` runs one turn per `hashCiFacts` change. Ack, ticks, and publish render the cell from the row and stamp `v=<version>`. Later writes use `applyCiProjectionBodyUpdate`: `head` must match unless superseded, `v` must be older; the verification-failure block is re-injected. `src/review/publish/reviewVerdictSurfaces.ts` owns the check and commit status. Owners: `src/review/ci/{ciFacts,ciAuthor,ciSummaryCell}.ts`.
